          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "us.\"",
          "start": 402.848,
          "end": 403.137,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, one needs to have an open mind and a free, freedom.",
      "start": 405.466,
      "end": 410.261,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
