      "end": 1252.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "Every",
          "start": 1250.48,
          "end": 1250.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "page",
          "start": 1250.88,
          "end": 1251.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "says",
          "start": 1251.28,
          "end": 1251.68,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\"God",
          "start": 1251.68,
          "end": 1252.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "alone.\"",
          "start": 1252.08,
          "end": 1252.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And they abandoned it. And this is documented in the Quran in Sura 25.",
