          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "inevitable.",
          "start": 1265.138,
          "end": 1265.559,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God, God says in Quran that He's never destroyed a land before bringing a messenger.",
