    {
      "text": "[9:61]  Some of them hurt the prophet by saying, \"He is all ears!\" Say, \"It is better for you that he listens to you. He believes in GOD, and trusts the believers. He is a mercy for those among you who believe.\" Those who hurt GOD's messenger have incurred a painful retribution.",
