          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "not.",
          "start": 3606.916,
          "end": 3607.202,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The utmost submitter is content with whatever God gives us, and understands.",
