          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "him.\"",
          "start": 4498.264,
          "end": 4498.797,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because God puts limits on him.",
