          "end": 4501.316,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "limits",
          "start": 4501.316,
          "end": 4501.57,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "on",
          "start": 4501.57,
          "end": 4501.824,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "him.",
          "start": 4501.824,
          "end": 4502.078,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When He sends him to test you, He puts limits on you. He says \"you can give her a cold and fever, but that's about it.",
